msgid "With no trusted proxy configured, forwarded headers are ignored entirely, deliberately, since believing them from anyone would let a client claim any address and slip past both rate limiting and account lockout. Behind a reverse proxy that means every failed sign-in is attributed to the proxy: name it above so lockout and the audit log see the real client."
